    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρᾰπλά̆σι-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fourfold, four times as
			much</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				369e
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τ. μέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					665.30
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>): c. gen., <i>four times as
				large as</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧπαρ τ. τοῦ βοείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					508a1
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζημίαν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
			τίνειν</span> pay a <i>fourfold</i> penalty, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				878c
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριπλασίαν</span> Orelli), cf.
				<i><span class="en">
				756e
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sm.
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					12.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
